{"step_index":438,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T02:26:44Z","thinking":"All industries are matched. Proceeding to update the 200 records. The script will use NICE BizINFO's `sanupscd_kor` to populate the `industry` field and will also update related category fields (`catLarge`, `catMid`, `catSmall`) based on the `industry` mapping. Additionally, the process includes verification for unmasked representative information, address, and corporate number within NICE BizINFO.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nconst list = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('verified_200_final.json', 'utf-8'));\\nconst niceResults = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('nice_200_results.json', 'utf-8'));\\nconst catMap = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('full_category_map.json', 'utf-8'));\\n\\nlet niceSanupApplied = 0;\\nlet corpNoFromNice = 0;\\nlet repFromNice = 0;\\n\\nlist.forEach((r, idx) => {\\n  const nice = niceResults[r.bizno];\\n  if (nice && nice.sanupscd_kor && nice.sanupscd_kor.trim()) {\\n    const oldInd = r.industry;\\n    const newInd = nice.sanupscd_kor.trim();\\n    if (oldInd !== newInd) {\\n      r.industry = newInd;\\n      niceSanupApplied++;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // Update categories based on the final industry (which now reflects NICE BizINFO's sanupscd_kor)\\n  const ind = r.industry ? r.industry.trim() : '';\\n  if (ind && catMap[ind]) {\\n    r.catLarge = catMap[ind].large;\\n    r.catMid = catMap[ind].mid;\\n    r.catSmall = catMap[ind].small;\\n  }\\n\\n  // If nice has corpNo and current record doesn't\\n  if (nice && nice.crpno && /^[0-9]{13}$/.test(nice.crpno.replace(/[^0-9]/g, ''))) {\\n    const cleanCrp = nice.crpno.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n    const formattedCrp = cleanCrp.slice(0, 6) + '-' + cleanCrp.slice(6);\\n    if (!r.corpNo) {\\n      r.corpNo = formattedCrp;\\n      r.closingMonth = '12월(추정)';\\n      corpNoFromNice++;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // If nice has representative unmasked\\n  if (nice && nice.korreprnm && !nice.korreprnm.includes('*') && (!r.ceo || r.ceo.includes('*'))) {\\n    r.ceo = nice.korreprnm.trim();\\n    repFromNice++;\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log(`Updated records with NICE BizINFO official 산업명: ${niceSanupApplied} / ${list.length}`);\\nconsole.log(`Additional CorpNos from NICE: ${corpNoFromNice}`);\\nconsole.log(`Additional unmasked CEOs from NICE: ${repFromNice}`);\\n\\nfs.writeFileSync('verified_200_final.json', JSON.stringify(list, null, 2), 'utf-8');\\n\\n// Also regenerate TSV and CSV\\nconst header18 = ['작성자', '상태', '회사명', '사업자번호', '대표자', '우편번호', '주소', '전\n<truncated 2529 bytes>","Description":"\"Apply NICE BizINFO 산업명 to all records and update TSVs\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\verify_and_update_db\\\\apply_nice_to_verified.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing apply_nice_to_verified.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Write apply_nice_to_verified.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
